1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,838
Iron is the working metal of the modern world.

2
00:00:02,838 --> 00:00:09,648
Nepal's Dhaubadi deposit in Nawalparasi is the basis of its first planned iron and steel plant.

3
00:00:09,648 --> 00:00:12,031
The chief ore is red haematite.

4
00:00:12,031 --> 00:00:14,518
Magnetite is the richest.

5
00:00:14,518 --> 00:00:20,950
Iron pyrite is never used for iron, because its sulphur makes the metal brittle when hot.

